      ],
      "descriptionMarkdown": "**Expected:** R1.C1's stated invocation runs the benchmarks.\n\n**Observed (original):** `cargo bench --bench hot_paths --features messagepack` exited 101 because the bench requires `bench-internals`; R1.C1's command and D1's `required-features = [\"messagepack\"]` contradicted D1's own gating, while the implementation was correct.\n\n**Repair (requested):** specification-only amendment.\n\n**Verified resolved:** R1.C1 now names `cargo bench --bench hot_paths --features messagepack,bench-internals` and D1 declares `required-features = [\"messagepack\", \"bench-internals\"]`, matching `Cargo.toml`, the `s1-bench-smoke` check and `docs/14-testing.md`.",
      "boundaryId": "S1"
    },
